        ],
        "flows": [
          "Initial read: GET /labels -> page.tsx -> server.ts verifies the user -> listLabels use-case -> LabelsRepository port -> supabase-repository.ts -> Supabase/Postgres under RLS -> map snake_case row to camelCase Label -> RSC passes initial labels to labels-client.tsx.",
