        "flows": [
          "Initial render: `app/labels/page.tsx` → `adapters/inbound/read/labels.ts` → verify session → `entries.listLabels` → `data/labels.ts` → Supabase under caller identity/RLS → parse row schema → map snake_case to camelCase → validate output → seed `LabelsPanel`. The RSC never calls its own HTTP endpoint.",
