            "topic": "Authentication",
            "choice": "Re-verify at every RSC read, Route Handler, and Server Action",
            "rationale": "Middleware refresh/protection and RLS are insufficient as the only authorization boundaries. All authority fields come from server context."
          },
          {
            "topic": "Validation and mapping",
            "choice": "Validate once per trust boundary and map inside the data module",
            "rationale": "Inbound code decodes transport, entries validate product contracts, and data validates stored rows. Snake_case rows never escape `data/labels.ts`."
          },
