            "topic": "Caching",
            "choice": "Client owns the interactive list after an RSC seed; GET responses use private browser caching",
            "rationale": "Return `Cache-Control: private, max-age=<short TTL>, must-revalidate` because results are authenticated. Normal filters may reuse browser cache; explicit refresh and post-mutation refresh use revalidation/no-cache. Avoid a shared server cache unless tags are tenant/user scoped."
